translate kr qst_guild_price_life_daughter_rescued_76fa786d:

    # MC "...Though if you could not tell anyone about what you saw back there when I changed-"
    MC "...다만 방금 전에 내가 변신했을 때 본 걸 아무한테도 말하지 않았으면 하는데..."
