    # "I thought for a moment about protesting against being called not human, but I decided it was best to avoid the conversation altogether and change the subject instead."
    "나는 잠시 인간이 아니라고 불리는 것에 항의할까 생각했지만, 대화를 완전히 피하고 대신 주제를 바꾸는 게 최선이라고 결정했다."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/PriceLife/scr_var_daughter.rpy:215
translate kr qst_guild_price_life_daughter_rescued_23a69b98:

    # MC "I must admit, {i}I'm surprised{/i} you're ... Well ..."
    MC "인정해야겠네, {i}놀랐어{/i} 네가... 글쎄..."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/PriceLife/scr_var_daughter.rpy:216
